kmap 1
id gb-dvorakukp
layout gb
variant dvorakukp
name English (UK, Dvorak, with UK punctuation)
level3 ralt
key TLDE ` ¬ | |
key AE01 1 !
key AE02 2 " ²
key AE03 3 £ ³
key AE04 4 $ €
key AE05 5 %
